{"ID":"20240220132620-w8btptz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132620-w8btptz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132620-w8btptz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164132-5app3u5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164132-mp0o2jx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164132-mp0o2jx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:10,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"【赤石脂禹余粮汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164132-5app3u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-5app3u5","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百七十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-1n0xckx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-1n0xckx","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,服汤药,下利不止,心下痞鞕，服「泻心汤」已,复以他药下之,利不止,医以「理中」与之,利益甚；「理中」者,理中焦,此利在下焦,「赤石脂禹余粮汤」主之,复利不止者,当利其小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-i10izv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-i10izv2","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有的时候并不是有了伤寒，你服药没好才会这样子，有的时候他一开始就是大肠炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-aihiy8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-aihiy8k","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辨是讲下痢不止，下痢是清谷。这个下痢会用到赤石脂，禹余粮的时候痢非常的凶，有时候会看到便血。一天跑个三四十次。如果止痢止不到，张仲景说用涩剂，你如果是没有下痢，吃赤石脂禹馀粮汤马上便秘，大便马上干掉，因为很涩。排都不容易排出来。如果用甘草泻心汤，很多的汤剂，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果热利，葛芩连汤都没有办法去的时候，就可以考虑使用涩剂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-x66q3xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-x66q3xh","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「赤石脂禹余粮汤」大部分用在大肠发炎的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怎么知道大肠发炎，先便后血，这个是痔疮，外痔。先血后便，内痔。血便混合在一起的下痢，这个是肠炎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-uul5xyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-uul5xyg","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你治下痢的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"利不止，用收敛的药，涩剂，祛湿的药也用了，消炎的药也用了，还是下痢，最后一条路利小便，把大肠的水利到膀胱里去，小便排出来，利就止掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果没有办法止痢的时候，痢小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-wzd0xif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-wzd0xif","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利小便有很多处方，五苓散、猪苓汤可以利小便。甚至说本来里面就有利，他是热利是葛芩连汤症，葛芩连下去了，好很多了，大便原来很臭，现在不臭了，还是有下痢，葛芩连汤里可以加一些猪苓茯苓，泽泻，一些利尿剂，张仲景的意思就在这里面，车前子也可以，车前子利尿。经方做基础。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-hiwobzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-hiwobzr","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤石脂禹余粮汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-n5vywpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-n5vywpu","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤石脂一斤碎，禹余粮一斤碎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-5pt52p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-5pt52p2","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味,以水六升,煮取二升,去滓,分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-w8qrl5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-w8qrl5g","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤石脂红色的，这两个都是石头类的药。这个药下去还下痢的时候，张仲景后面还用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤石脂一半煮一半生用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164132-mp0o2jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164132-mp0o2jx","updated":"20240312164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分温三服，一天三次。"}]}]}